<section class="cta-final">
  <div class="cta-final-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="cta-final-block" data-reveal="1">
    <h2>Vamos construir algo <span>sólido</span> juntos</h2>
    <p>Conte o que você precisa. Quem responde é quem vai desenvolver.</p>
    <a
      href="https://wa.me/5516996111785"
      class="cta-final-link"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
    >
      Começar um projeto
      <svg
        aria-hidden="true"
        width="18"
        height="18"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="1.6"
        stroke-linecap="round"
      >
        <path d="M5 12h13"></path>
        <path d="M12.5 6l6 6-6 6"></path>
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-final {
    position: relative;
    z-index: var(--z-section);
    background: var(--color-bg);
    padding: clamp(5.625rem, 11vw, 10rem) var(--space-gutter);
  }

  .cta-final-glow {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: min(1000px, 130%);
    height: 640px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--color-accent-glow-strong) 0%, transparent 60%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: var(--z-glow);
    animation: dmPulse 7s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .cta-final-block {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 51.25rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .cta-final-block h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    font-size: clamp(2.125rem, 5vw, 4.25rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    color: var(--color-text-strong);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .cta-final-block h2 span {
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }

  .cta-final-block p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 30rem;
    font-family: var(--font-text);
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    line-height: var(--leading-body);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .cta-final-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-5) var(--space-8);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-text-on-accent);
    font-family: var(--font-text);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-accent);
    transition:
      background-color var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-standard),
      box-shadow var(--dur-fast) var(--ease-standard);
  }

  .cta-final-link:hover,
  .cta-final-link:focus-visible {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-accent-lg);
  }

  .cta-final-link svg {
    flex: none;
  }
</style>
